        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yehu neko nyikway Ahab",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onyo Ahab oyido nitie gi nyikwaye piero abirio ma jobedo i Samaria. Yehu ondiko balwin ri jodhum ma tindin madongo, jodongo, kodi ri jokur pa nyikway Ahab. Balwa no oyido waco ni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nyikway kere jonitie i cingin aka winitie gi cawilin, kayinin, gilweny, kodi tindin madongo m'othok gi cel. Ameno tekin wilimo balwa me, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yer win nyakwar jadwoŋ mewin manitie gi nyalo, kethi win go kere, aka wilweny rigo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jodhum ma Samaria jobwok aka jowaco ni, “Neni, kerin ario jok'onyalo cungo ruwaŋe, wan wanonyal nedi?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ameno jatel pa jolweny ma cel pa kere kodi jadhum ma tindi madwoŋ, kanyacel gi jodongo kodi jokur jodhiro ri Yehu mikwenda me ni, “Wabedo ŋecin perin aka wayikere timo gim'iwaco je. To wakibino ketho nyatoro kere; tim gimaber i waŋin.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehu ondiko rijo balwa man ni, “Ka winitie i thenge paran aka wiyikere luwo cik paran, keli ran win wic nyikway Ahab i sawa me dikin.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onyo jodongo ma Samaria ama oyido jokuro nyikway Ahab. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munyo balwa pa Yehu otundo, jotel ma Samaria joneko nyikway Ahab piero abirio je, joketho wic gin i aditin, aka jodhiro ri Yehu i Yezirel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munyo owaci ri Yehu nike okeli wic nyikway Ahab, owodho or nike wodhur jo i kidhur ario i waŋkac ma tindi madwoŋ aka wowey kenyo tundo yawere odikin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Odikin, Yehu owok i waŋkac aka owaco ri ji ma kenyo ni, “An aŋat'acamo sereko ri kere Yoram t'aneko go; win wingoye gi banja. To ŋa m'oneko me gin? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Me ridho nike gima Rwoth owaco je kwoŋ nyikway Ahab bino tundo i kare. Rwoth otimo gim'ociko luwo bongi jatuci wac Were pere Elia.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HOS.1.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Hos 1:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kenyo Yehu oneko wade pa Ahab m'odoŋ je m'oyido jobedo i Yezirel, jotel pa jolweny pere, merin, kodi jocway ri Were i wi migam, cuka ongoye ŋat'odoŋ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yehu neko wade pa Ahazia",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehu oeye Yezirel kadho i Samaria. I yo i kabedo m'ilwoŋo ni “Kambi pa jokwath rombo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oromo gi wade pa Ahazia kere ma Yuda mogo, aka openjo jo ni, “Wibedo jokune?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jodwoko ni, “Wabedo wade pa Ahazia. Wakadho wendo ri nyithindho pa Yezebel yok kere kodi jopeco pa kere man.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehu omiyo cwo pere cik ni, “Maki win jo makwo.” Jomako jo aka Yehu oneko jo cegin gi bur kenyo. Joje oyido piero aŋwen g'ario aka ongoye kwoŋ jo m'owey makwo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yehu neko wade pa Ahab m'odoŋ",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehu oeye kenyo aka oromo gi Yehonadab wod pa Rekab. Yehu omotho go aka owaco rigo ni, “In, kodi an wanitie gi paro acel. Inothielan?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehonadab odwoko ni, “Ey.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehu odwoko ni, “Miyan cingin to.” Jogwaro cingi gin, aka Yehu okonyo Yehonadab idho i cawila, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ka waco ama: “Biye kodan ineni nger m'amiyere ri Rwoth.” Aka ogweyo Yehonadab i cawila pere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka munyo Yehu otundo i Samaria, oneko wade pa Ahab m'oyido jodoŋ je ma k'oweyo kad'acel. Me a gima Rwoth oyido owaco ri Elia nike bino timere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yehu neko ji m'oyido jolamo Bal",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kenyo Yehu ocoko ji je kanyacel, aka owaco rijo ni, “Ahab oyido lamo Bal roman, to an abino tiyo rigo kicutho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onyo riameno lwoŋ ran win jotuci wac were pa Bal je, ji ma jolamo go kodi jocway ri were i wi migam pere je; wongoye ŋata wokeŋ, rupiri anitie gi cowirok madwoŋ ma mito miyo Bal. Ŋata k'obino je bino tho.” (To me obedo rieko pa Yehu ŋey woneki ji m'oyido jolamo Bal je.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kenyo Yehu owodho or ni, “Kethi win ndelo ma lamo ma miyo Bal dwoŋ!” Ameno joketho ndelo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehu odhiro wac i lowo ma Isiraili gipi. Ji je m'oyido jolamo Bal jobino m'ongoye ŋata k'obino. Joje jodonjo i ot pa Bal, aka ot opoŋ wok i gike tundo i gike. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kenyo Yehu omiyo jocway ri were i wi migam m'oyido jokuro kabada wodho kanzin jowomiy ji m'oyido jolamo Bal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rumacen Yehu won odonjo i ot pa Bal gi Yehonadab wod pa Rekab aka owaco ri ji ni, “Neni win nike nyaka ji ma jolamo Bal kende ama jodonjo ka aka ongoye ŋata lamo Rwoth m'odonjo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kenyo Yehu kodi Yehonadab jodonjo miyo cowirok kodi mic awaŋa ri Bal. Yehu oyido otieko ketho cwo piero aboro woko thoko ot pa Bal aka owaco rijo ni, “Wiripo neko ji me je; Ŋat'owey acel kwoŋ jo kwalok bino culo gi kwo pere!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ameno tekin Yehu ketho mic, owaco ri jokur kodi jotel pa jolweny ni, “Donji win wineki joje, wikiri wiwey kada ŋat'acel kwalok.” Jodonjo aka joneko joje g'abor, to jowotho delkwoŋ gin woko. Kenyo jodonjo i kisika ma iy ot pa Bal, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "jowodho siro m'oyido nitie kenyo to jowaŋo woko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ameno jonyeko siro kodi ot pa Bal, aka joloko ot pa Bal coron ma fodi nitie kiri konon.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
