            "sid": "2KI 10:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ameno apaka Yehu ocungo lamo Bal i Isiraili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.12.28+1KI.12.29+1KI.12.30"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Kerin 12:28-30",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To Yehu oluwo reco pa kere Yerobowam m'omiyo Isiraili timo reco ma lamo rwath dhok ma zahabu m'oketho i Bethel kodi i Dan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwoth owaco ri Yehu ni, “Itieko timo ri nyikway Ahab gigipiny je m'oyido amito ni itimi. Ameno acikin ni nyikwayin, kiri i luse mar'aŋwen, jobino bedo kere i Isiraili.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To Yehu k'oluwo cik pa Rwoth, Were pa Isiraili gi cunye je, kwanyo woko oluwo kite pa Yerobowam, m'omiyo Isiraili timo reco.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Tho pa Yehu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I hongo no Rwoth ocako ŋado woko adec pa Isiraili. Kere Hazael ma Siria omako adec je ma Isiraili ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yuwok ceŋ ma Yordan, kiri yupiny kiri i tindi Arower i malawa Arnon. Me obedo adec ma Giliad kodi Basan, kama nonin pa Gad, Ruben, kodi yuwok ceŋ pa Manase oyido jobed'iye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
